{#
settings/_templates.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
The Templates section: the tree of what there is, and one editor.

Side by side once the pane is wide enough to hold both, stacked below that —
by container query rather than breakpoint, for the reason settings/index
documents: this pane's width and the window's do not move together.

The tree is the left column on a wide pane and the top on a narrow one, in
both cases FIRST: after every write the editor closes and the tree is what
says whether the write worked, so it must be what is on screen.

Variables:
  tree  App\Domain\DTO\Template\TemplateTree
#}
<div class="@3xl:grid @3xl:grid-cols-[16rem_minmax(0,1fr)] @3xl:divide-x divide-line">
    <div id="settings-template-tree" class="min-w-0 border-b border-line @3xl:border-b-0">
        {% include 'settings/templates/_tree.html.twig' with { tree: tree } only %}
    </div>

    <div class="min-w-0">
        {% include 'settings/templates/_editor_empty.html.twig' %}
    </div>
</div>
